# Code Quality Limits
RULE: File 900 max; function 50; class 300; complexity 10; imports 30; params 5. Split by SRP when exceeded.
WHY: Enforced in quality gates; maintains maintainability.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/file-splitting-guide.md, quality-gates-service-template.sh
DO: Extract helpers; use composition; split files >900 lines; McCabe max-complexity 10
NEVER: Exceed limits without refactor; add to ignore; bypass enforcement
